WEBVTT

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.550
DATS Team Annihilated!?

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:09.550
Clash with Mercurimon

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:07.720
DATS Team annihilated!?

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.550
Clash with Mercurimon!

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.890
Yoshino overcame the shadows in her heart,

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:16.460
enabling Lalamon to evolve into her Perfect form, Lilamon.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.880
Marvel Shot!

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:26.130
Meanwhile, the mysterious boy Ikuto insisted that he was a Digimon,

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.020
and even said that his mother, Yukidarumon, was killed by humans.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:37.230
Just when Masaru and the others finally reached Infinity Ice Ridge,

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.530
they found an unexpected person waiting for them.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.900
I couldn't even catch one fish!

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.470
This bait is horrible.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:51.460
Man, you sure show up in places when we least expect it.

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.560
Maybe he's actually a Digimon!

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.590
Don't be stupid, that's impossible.

00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:58.820
Why are you so familiar with him anyway?

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.140
This is the guy who gave me my Digivice.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.120
Your Digivice?

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:05.100
So, that means he's...

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.430
Up we go.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.520
All right, this way. Follow me.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:11.980
Hey, hold on!

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.950
You want to find Mercurimon, right?

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.830
You know where he is?

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.860
Well, I did say "follow me."

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:20.940
What should we do?

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:24.090
We don't know if we can trust this man.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:26.040
I trust him.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:26.580
Masaru?

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:31.670
We need to get to Mercurimon either way.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.590
If following him means getting there, then I'll trust that old guy!

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:36.310
Yeah!

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:38.800
We won't get anywhere just by standing here!

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:40.500
Let's go, Agumon!

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.390
Yeah!

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:42.130
Hey!

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:45.430
Oh man, all those two ever do is rush into things!

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.270
Wait for me!

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:56.410
Ikuto, I can sense something is troubling you deeply.

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:02.830
<i>You're human just like me!</i>

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:07.140
Mercurimon!

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.460
I'm... Digimon, aren't I?!

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:11.000
Ikuto...

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.300
Why are you hesitating?

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.320
You are a Digimon warrior.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:16.460
Humans are the enemy.

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.180
Ikuto, are you okay?

00:02:22.360 --> 00:02:24.670
I am Digimon...

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:26.420
Humans enemy...

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.900
Here's the entrance.

00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:49.540
Take that!

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:55.650
Nice hook, old man!

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:58.070
Why couldn't it have been a fish?

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:00.260
Kuramon

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:00.260
Baby Level

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.260
That was Kuramon.

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:03.750
Does that mean... it was watching us all this time?

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.470
Probably.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:08.890
Come on, keep your heads down while we walk.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.410
The ground is slippery, so watch your step.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.120
Old man, don't just stop suddenly like that!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.280
We've been discovered already.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:41.590
Tsumemon

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:41.590
Child Level

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.250
Tsumemon.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:38.860
A Child Level Digimon that destroys data at a shocking speed.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.590
It moves very quickly and is hard to catch!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:46.720
Humans? Humans are here?!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.570
Baby Flame!

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:55.690
Double Backhand!

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.340
Nuts Shoot!

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:02.900
Baby Flame!

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:06.910
Baby Burner!

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:13.120
Just you wait, Mercurimon!

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.990
Mercurimon-sama!

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.570
Those wretched humans, they've... they've finally entered the palace!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:20.590
Calm yourself.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.660
But... but...!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.700
I fight!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.760
Defeat humans!

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:29.720
Ikuto!

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.040
Why?

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.030
Why let Ikuto go?

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:39.520
With Mercurimon-sama's power, we can easily defeat those humans!

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:45.490
Letting Ikuto fight with humans will help him awaken into a true Digimon warrior.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.910
Human scum is still human scum.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:04.800
That's...

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.200
Mercurimon's hideout?

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:09.890
It's beautiful!

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:11.810
Like an ice palace.

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:14.010
Now's not the time for admiration!

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.870
It's the same as being in the midst of enemy territory.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.690
We can be attacked at any moment.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.780
Heh, we'll show them if they dare!

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:25.400
Nothing's gonna stop us, not even Mercurimon!

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.110
Watch out!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.750
Filthy humans, I will beat you!

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.700
That kid... could it be...?

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.190
All right, let's put an end to this!

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.480
I'm Digimon warrior.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.730
Defeat all Mercurimon's enemy!

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.840
Don't get in our way, Ikuto!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.130
Ikuto?

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:09.460
I knew it, that's Noguchi's...!

00:07:12.190 --> 00:07:13.500
Baby Flame!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.350
Shuririnken!

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:19.060
Nuts Shoot!

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:24.730
Gao Rush!

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:28.780
Gaomon!

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.180
Stop!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.430
Ikuto, you are...!

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.410
Ikuto!

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:45.010
I've come to help!

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:46.710
Gotsumon!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.820
Angry Rock!

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:55.860
Angry Rock!

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:03.190
All of you will be smashed to pieces!

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:05.490
What you mean "all?"

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:06.150
Gotsumon!

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:07.980
Angry Rock!

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.320
Aniki!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.430
Ikuto!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:24.670
Yoshino!

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:25.880
Master!

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:41.410
That Gotsumon, he's too reckless...

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:45.740
Aniki!

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.140
Where's Aniki?!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.730
Aniki!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.480
Master.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.080
Thanks, Gaomon.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.640
Are you okay, Yoshino?

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.970
Somewhat...

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.210
Where are Masaru and Agumon?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:07.830
Don't move!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:11.040
Don't any of you move a muscle!

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:14.490
Oh no you don't!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.920
Drop the machines!

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:20.010
This is the worst...

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:24.020
Now, let's see what I should do with you next.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.610
You're not worth the trouble.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:28.350
What did you say?!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.520
Mercurimon! You're watching this, aren't you?

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.320
I've got something to ask you.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.530
Let's be honest with each other.

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:38.570
Insolence! Such insolence!

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:39.860
The human assumes too much!

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:41.910
Wait.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:45.500
Bring that man here.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:49.420
Yes, at once...

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.520
Aniki...

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:02.680
Let go!

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:03.450
Don't joke around!

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:04.370
Let go!

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.930
I don't want to be saved by human!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.600
Stop talking crap!

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.900
Aniki, are you okay?

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.110
That was nothing.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.570
That damn Gotsumon.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.700
<i>All of you will be smashed to pieces!</i>

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:31.230
Why you save me?

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:33.500
Isn't it obvious?

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:36.350
We haven't finished our battle yet.

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:39.760
How could I watch you die just like that?

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:48.200
What the hell happened?

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:53.180
Aniki!

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.030
This looks like a bad situation.

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.450
Let's find the others quickly!

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.870
Yeah!

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:03.240
Ikuto, we'll settle our fight later!

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:05.120
Let's go, Agumon!

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.000
Yeah!

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.000
Ikuto...

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:17.190
I think they're somehow different from the humans who killed Yukidarumon.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:21.970
Maybe there are good humans out there, too?

00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:29.140
There's no way!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.800
I haven't seen you in a while.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.070
It's been ten years.

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:45.000
Looks like you still remember me.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.240
You know Mercurimon?

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.800
Master... what is...?

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:51.450
I see.

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:56.840
This man was a member of the Digital World Exploration Squad from ten years ago.

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:59.310
The Digital World Exploration Squad?

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.470
What happened to Ikuto?

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:06.180
W-Well... um...

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:10.610
You've been raising a human child?

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:13.140
Ikuto is like a son to me.

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:16.060
Humans have taught me what it is like to be a father.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:19.130
Then why are you attacking the human world?

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.140
Silence!

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:23.490
It was humans who struck first!

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.320
What did you say?

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:30.490
It's true that we humans arrived unexpectedly in the Digital World ten years ago,

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:33.800
but we never intended to be aggressive!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:35.960
You understood that best!

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:38.170
How dare you spout such lies!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:41.880
Aniki! This is the top floor.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.230
Damn it!

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:44.660
Where is everyone?

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:50.720
Ikuto!

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:51.930
Fight me!

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:54.100
Now's not the time for this!

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:55.100
Fight me!

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:59.640
That man made a deal with us.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:02.570
To preserve the peace between the Digital World and the human world,

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:05.570
neither side would attack the other.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.620
"That man...?"

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:11.620
But humans went back on their word.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.250
Without a single warning,

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.000
they killed a large number of Digimon!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.120
What?!

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.540
Humans... killed Yukidarumon!

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:22.800
Never forgive you!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:24.970
Hang on!

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.530
What do you mean, killed?

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:29.490
If Digimon lose in battle, don't they just turn back into Digieggs?

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.470
They can't die!

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:33.770
Yukidarumon didn't turn into Digiegg!

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:36.730
Disappeared completely, didn't leave anything!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.040
What?!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.990
That can happen?!

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:42.510
Yukidarumon was murdered!

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:45.290
I will never forget...

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.740
the ruthless actions of the humans!

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:52.460
Humans massacred Digimon everywhere they went...

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:58.110
None could be born again because they didn't leave behind even a scrap of data.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.130
We were tricked!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:05.700
N-No way...

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:07.790
I won't believe such a thing!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:11.590
We were all for peace between Digimon and humans, and...

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:14.520
Still with the lies!

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:18.670
Even now, you have broken down the wall between the two worlds.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:22.350
Is it not to create chaos in the Digital World?

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:23.200
Never!

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.610
Humans have done nothing!

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.440
Silence!

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:29.400
I can't stand it anymore!

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.410
Humans who do not admit to their wrongdoing...

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:36.530
should be silenced for eternity!

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:43.420
Aniki!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.880
You won't get away from the next one!

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.550
Hang on one damn second!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:09.540
Masaru!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.780
We finally meet, Mercurimon!

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:18.450
That burning Digisoul in your fist...

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:22.540
Don't tell me you've forgotten Daimon Masaru-sama!

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:24.500
Daimon?

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.710
Could you be Daimon Suguru's son?

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.710
How do you know my dad?

00:15:29.710 --> 00:15:32.180
There's no need for me to answer you!

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:33.750
Damn it!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:36.470
I'll just have to force you to tell me!

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:37.560
Tohma! Yoshino!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.410
Let's go!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:39.890
Yeah!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:39.890
Yeah!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:42.020
Digisoul...

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:47.690
Full Charge!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.950
Agumon, evolve!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.570
Gaomon, evolve!

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:09.760
Lalamon, evolve!

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:18.670
RiseGreymon!

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.250
MachGaogamon!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:31.770
Lilamon!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.480
Mercurimon!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.070
Ikuto!

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:40.700
Gotsumon!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.060
Ikuto, stay back.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.130
Let's do this!

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:53.240
Lila Shower!

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.880
Winning Knuckle!

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:07.400
Trident Revolver!

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:15.560
Thousand Fist!

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.250
Wow!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.330
As expected of Mercurimon-sama!

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:32.750
Our power doesn't even scratch him?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.340
The three of you attack at the same time!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.680
If you combine your attacks, it'll be more powerful!

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:42.010
We've never tried that before! Don't be reckless!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:44.350
Gutsy as always.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:45.180
Tohma!

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:49.070
No matter what, we'll force out an advantage for ourselves!

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:50.570
That's what a man does!

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:51.500
Yeah!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.180
All right! Everyone altogether!

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:00.870
Okay!

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:04.090
Lila Shower!

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.900
Howling Cannon!

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:12.460
Rising Destroyer!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.690
T-The door to the Digital Gate has been...!

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:38.190
The Digital Gate is inside there...

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.570
You were able to injure me...

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:51.130
Not good!

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:06.350
Agumon!

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:07.400
Lalamon!

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:08.650
Hang in there...

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.580
Gaomon! Are you all right?

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.400
M-Master...

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:19.070
This next one will send you to oblivion!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:25.660
Kamemon, Realize!

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.250
Kamemon~

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:33.900
Old man!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:34.580
Kamemon?

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:40.000
Digisoul Charge!

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:43.490
Kamemon, evolve!

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:51.300
Gawappamon, yeah!

00:19:51.810 --> 00:20:00.610
Gawappamon

00:19:51.810 --> 00:20:00.610
Adult Level

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:53.530
Gawappamon.

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.090
An Adult Level Digimon who is always cheerful and energetic.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:20:00.610
His special attack is to shoot high speed spinning discs from his head, DJ Shooter.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:03.070
DJ Shooter!

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:18.250
You want us to run without even beating him?!

00:20:18.250 --> 00:20:19.360
Enough! Just run!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.720
No way! How can we retreat like this?

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:25.300
